{% extends '@rental/management/_booking_frame.html.twig' %}
{#
  « Courrier » — the mail of rentals' own mailbox (Booking\BookingPage::MAIL),
  offered only when exactly one box is dedicated to them (issue #462, D8),
  on the triage screen the camps use too (@inbound_mail/partials/triage.html.twig,
  issue #462, D9): one component, two modules, so the two screens cannot
  drift apart.

  Its scope is the manager's, not the page's booking: the mail of every
  booking of every asset they manage (RentalCommunicationService::
  triageBookings()), recomputed on every action. The booking the page
  belongs to is the picker's default, nothing more.

  Every form carries the page's own context (asset, booking, page), so an
  action answers through bookingAction() like every other form of the
  file — asynchronously, the panel below re-rendered in place — and,
  without JavaScript, comes back here.
#}
{% block booking_content %}
    {# The page exists only because rentals have a mailbox of their own
       (issue #462, D8), so it says so — and says what follows from it: the
       whole box, not only what is filed, and the address renters answer. #}
    <div class="card mb-3">
        <div class="card-body small text-body-secondary">
            Cette page existe parce que les locations disposent d'une boîte dédiée,
            <strong>{{ mailbox_address }}</strong>. Elle montre donc tout son courrier, pas seulement
            les messages déjà rattachés à une réservation. Les e-mails que le site envoie aux
            locataires portent cette adresse en réponse.
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="{{ boxes.mail.anchor }}">
        <div data-booking-panel="communications">
            {% include '@inbound_mail/partials/triage.html.twig' with {
                messages: messages, status: status, counts: counts,
                include_bulk: include_bulk, bulk_count: bulk_count,
                triage_ui: {
                    has_inbound_mail: true,
                    filter_url: booking_page.url(booking_url),
                    urls: {
                        reanalyze: '/mes-locations/courrier/relancer',
                        attach: '/mes-locations/courrier/rattacher',
                        detach: '/mes-locations/courrier/detacher',
                        dismiss: '/mes-locations/courrier/ecarter',
                        restore: '/mes-locations/courrier/reprendre',
                        confirm: '/mes-locations/courrier/proposition/confirmation',
                        reject: '/mes-locations/courrier/proposition/rejet',
                    },
                    hidden: { asset_id: asset.id, booking_id: booking.id, booking_page: booking_page.value },
                    list_name: 'des locations',
                    noun_from: 'de la réservation',
                    attach_other: 'Rattacher à une autre réservation',
                    attach_also: 'Rattacher aussi à une autre réservation',
                    labels: triage_labels,
                    reference_urls: triage_urls,
                    booking_options: triage_booking_options,
                    picker_template: '@rental/management/_triage_picker.html.twig',
                },
            } only %}
        </div>
    </div>
    {% include '@inbound_mail/partials/triage_dialog.html.twig' %}
{% endblock %}

{% block booking_scripts %}
    <script src="{{ asset('/assets/js/mail-message-dialog.js') }}" defer></script>
{% endblock %}
